<title>USA: U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA report of frozen concentrated orange juice stocks in cold storage, in 1000s of units:</p>
<p>    -	  05/31/97	04/30/97---(Previous)   05/31/96</p>
<p> Gallons	218,710	 201,488     201,551     161,370</p>
<p> Lbs	  2,164,356     1,993,925   1,994,551   1,596,917</p>
<p>Note-FCOJ stocks are based on 42.0 degrees Brix equivalent of 9.896 lbs per gallon.</p>
<p>USDA said the FCOJ total was the highest on record since recordkeeping began in 1949. The previous mark was 1.994 billion lbs, set in April.</p>
</text>
